{
  "comment": "The sounds tools/fetch_audio.py fetches: zips at fixed URLs, the files picked from under `root` by pattern, written to cc0/<dest> with the pack's licence; short sounds as mono WAV, those marked keep_ogg as they are. audio.lock.json records each download's sha256. Kenney's CC0 packs are placeholders until the picks of the audio sources note land; manifest.json says which file plays for which cue.",
